e:
As with ghoti, the goal of the word is to highlight the irregularities of English orthography by deliberately exaggerating them.
* gh, /p/ as in hiccough, /ˈhɪ.kʌp/;
* ough, /ə/ as in thorough, /ˈθʌɹ.ə/;
* phth, /t/ as in phthisis, /ˈtaɪ.sɪs/;
* eigh, /eɪ/ as in neighbor, /ˈneɪ.bɚ/;
* tte, /t/ as in gazette, /ɡəˈzɛt/; and
* eau, /oʊ/ as in plateau, /plæˈtoʊ/
